  {
   "q_en": "<p>If [(a/x) + (b/y)] = 1 and [(x/a) + (y/b)] = -4/3, then what is the value of [(a/x)<sup>3</sup> + (b/y)<sup>3</sup>]?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; [(a/x) + (b/y)] = 1 &#2324;&#2352; [(x/a) + (y/b)] = -4/3, &#2340;&#2379; [(a/x)<sup>3</sup> + (b/y)<sup>3</sup>] &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "(9/4)",
    "(13/4)",
    "(17/4)",
    "(13/7)"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "(9/4)",
    "(13/4)",
    "(17/4)",
    "(13/7)"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>[(a/x) + (b/y)] = 1</p><p>Let (a/x) = p and (b/y) = q</p><p>(p + q) = 1 ......... (1)</p><p>[(x/a) + (y/b)] = -4/3</p><p>(1/p) + (1/q) = -4/3</p><p>(q + p)pq = -4/3</p><p>1/pq = -4/3</p><p>pq = -3/4 ........ (2)</p><p>= [(a/x)<sup>3</sup> + (b/y)<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>= [p<sup>3</sup> + q<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>= (p + q)<sup>3</sup>  -  3pq(p + q)</p><p>From equations (1) and (2)-</p><p>= 1<sup>3</sup>  -  3 * (-3/4) * (1)</p><p>= 1 + (9/4)</p><p>= (13/4)</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>[(a/x) + (b/y)] = 1</p><p>Let (a/x) = p and (b/y) = q</p><p>(p + q) = 1 ......... (1)</p><p>[(x/a) + (y/b)] = -4/3</p><p>(1/p) + (1/q) = -4/3</p><p>(q + p)pq = -4/3</p><p>1/pq = -4/3</p><p>pq = -3/4 ........ (2)</p><p>= [(a/x)<sup>3</sup> + (b/y)<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>= [p<sup>3</sup> + q<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>= (p + q)<sup>3</sup>  -  3pq(p + q)</p><p>From equations (1) and (2)-</p><p>= 1<sup>3</sup>  -  3 * (-3/4) * (1)</p><p>= 1 + (9/4)</p><p>= (13/4)</p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
