   "q_en": "<p>If (4m + n)/(3m + 4n) = 4/7, then what is the value of <img width=104 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18075/image006.png\">?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (4m + n)/(3m + 4n) = 4/7, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?<img width=104 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18075/image006.png\">?</p>",
   "options_en": [
