   "solution_hi": "<p>(4m + n)/(3m + 4n) = 4/7</p><p>=&gt; 28m + 7n = 12m + 16n</p><p>=&gt; 16m = 9n</p><p>=&gt; m/n = 9/16</p><p>Let m = 9k and n = 16k</p><p>So,</p><p><img width=104 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18075/image006.png\"></p><p>= 40/41 * ((9k)<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 9k * 16k)/(3*(16k)<sup>2</sup> + 3 * 9k * 16k)</p><p>= 40/41 * 123/400</p><p>= 3/10</p>",
