   "q_en": "<p>If (2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>) = 4a(x<sup>3</sup>  -  by<sup>3</sup>), then find the value of (a + b  -  ab).</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (2x - 4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>) = 4a(x<sup>3</sup> - by<sup>3</sup>) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (a + b - ab) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p>",
