   "answer": 2,
   "solution_en": "<p>Given,</p><p>(2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>) = 4a(x<sup>3</sup>  -  by<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>LHS = (2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (2x  -  4y)[(2x)<sup>2</sup> + (2x) * (4y) + (4y)<sup>2</sup>]</p><p>= (2x)<sup>3</sup>  -  (4y)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 8x<sup>3</sup>  -  64y<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 8(x<sup>3</sup>  -  8y<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>Now compare with RHS,</p><p>We get 4a = 8 or a = 2 and b = 8</p><p>The value of (a + b  -  ab) = (2 + 8  -  16) = 10  -  16 = -6.</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>Given,</p><p>(2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>) = 4a(x<sup>3</sup>  -  by<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>LHS = (2x  -  4y)(4x<sup>2</sup> + 8xy + 16y<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= (2x  -  4y)[(2x)<sup>2</sup> + (2x) * (4y) + (4y)<sup>2</sup>]</p><p>= (2x)<sup>3</sup>  -  (4y)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 8x<sup>3</sup>  -  64y<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 8(x<sup>3</sup>  -  8y<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>Now compare with RHS,</p><p>We get 4a = 8 or a = 2 and b = 8</p><p>The value of (a + b  -  ab) = (2 + 8  -  16) = 10  -  16 = -6.</p>",
