   "q_en": "<p>If 729X<sup>3</sup>  -  125Y<sup>3</sup> = (AX + BY)(CX<sup>2</sup>  -  DY<sup>2</sup> + 45XY) where A, B, C and D are integers, then what is the value of 7A + B  -  C - D?</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 729X<sup>3</sup> - 125Y<sup>3</sup> = (AX + BY)(CX<sup>2</sup> - DY<sup>2</sup> + 45XY) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; A, B, C &#2324;&#2352; D &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; 7A + B - C - D &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "3",
    "2",
    "1",
    "4"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "3",
    "2",
    "1",
    "4"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>729X<sup>3</sup>  -  125Y<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 729X<sup>3</sup> + (-125Y<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>= (9X)<sup>3</sup> + (-5Y)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= (9X - 5Y)(81X<sup>2</sup> + 25Y<sup>2</sup> + 45XY)</p><p>= (9X + (-5)Y)(81X<sup>2</sup>  -  (-25Y<sup>2</sup>) + 45XY)</p><p>= (AX + BY)(CX<sup>2</sup>  -  DY<sup>2</sup> + 45XY),</p><p>Therefore A = 9, B = -5, C = 81, D = -25</p><p>7A + B  -  C - D = 63  -  5  -  81 + 25 = 58  -  56 = 2</p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>729X<sup>3</sup>  -  125Y<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 729X<sup>3</sup> + (-125Y<sup>3</sup>)</p><p>= (9X)<sup>3</sup> + (-5Y)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= (9X - 5Y)(81X<sup>2</sup> + 25Y<sup>2</sup> + 45XY)</p><p>= (9X + (-5)Y)(81X<sup>2</sup>  -  (-25Y<sup>2</sup>) + 45XY)</p><p>= (AX + BY)(CX<sup>2</sup>  -  DY<sup>2</sup> + 45XY),</p><p>Therefore A = 9, B = -5, C = 81, D = -25</p><p>7A + B  -  C - D = 63  -  5  -  81 + 25 = 58  -  56 = 2</p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
