  {
   "q_en": "<p>If (2x  -  3y)<sup>2 </sup> -  (2x + y)<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy = y(ay  -  bx), then find the value of a + b.</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (2x - 3y)<sup>2 </sup> - (2x + y)<sup>2</sup> - 2xy = y(ay - bx) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; a + b &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p>",
   "options_en": [
    "22",
    "26",
    "18",
    "30"
   ],
   "options_hi": [
    "22",
    "26",
    "18",
    "30"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "solution_en": "<p>We know, (a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 2ab</p><p>And, (a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2ab</p><p>Here, (2x  -  3y)<sup>2 </sup> -  (2x + y)<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy = y(ay  -  bx)</p><p>(4x<sup>2</sup> + 9y<sup>2</sup>  -  12xy)  -  (4x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + 4xy)  -  2xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup> + 9y<sup>2</sup>  -  12xy  -  4x<sup>2</sup>  -  y<sup>2</sup>  -  4xy  -  2xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>8y<sup>2</sup>  -  18xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>Comparing coefficients of y<sup>2</sup> and xy in the above equation we get</p><p>a = 8, b = 18</p><p>Therefore, a + b = 8 + 18 = <b>26</b></p>",
   "solution_hi": "<p>We know, (a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 2ab</p><p>And, (a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2ab</p><p>Here, (2x  -  3y)<sup>2 </sup> -  (2x + y)<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy = y(ay  -  bx)</p><p>(4x<sup>2</sup> + 9y<sup>2</sup>  -  12xy)  -  (4x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + 4xy)  -  2xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup> + 9y<sup>2</sup>  -  12xy  -  4x<sup>2</sup>  -  y<sup>2</sup>  -  4xy  -  2xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>8y<sup>2</sup>  -  18xy = ay<sup>2</sup>  -  bxy</p><p>Comparing coefficients of y<sup>2</sup> and xy in the above equation we get</p><p>a = 8, b = 18</p><p>Therefore, a + b = 8 + 18 = <b>26</b></p>",
   "marks": 1.0,
   "neg": 0.25
  },
  {
   "q_en": "<p>(x/y) + (y/x) = P and (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>) = 0, then find the value of P. [where (x + y) &#8800; 0]</p>",
   "q_hi": "<p>(x/y) + (y/x) = P &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>) = 0 &#2361;&#2376; , &#2340;&#2379; P &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; |(&#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; (x + y) &#8800; 0)</p>",
