   "solution_en": "<p>(x/y) + (y/x) = P</p><p>(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>) = Pxy</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  Pxy = 0 ..... (1)</p><p>Now, (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>) = 0</p><p>=&gt; (x + y)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy) = 0</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy = 0 ..... (2) [(x + y) &#8800; 0]</p><p>Compare equation (1) and (2)-</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  Pxy = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy</p><p>=&gt; P = 1</p>",
